Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.45,0:04:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,1000)\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H404040&\fs19\1a&H00&\2c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&\pos(102.4,251.022)}Episode 5: Beef Carbonnade
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.04,0:05:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Who might this be?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.12,0:05:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Lenka!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.76,0:05:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.48,0:05:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Lilotte!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.32,0:05:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We have a visitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.52,0:05:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Lenka, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.76,0:05:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Joris,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.60,0:05:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,did someone arrive?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.56,0:05:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It's rare for us to welcome such a special guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.52,0:05:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,This girl is a Bellaphone!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.80,0:05:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Bellaphone!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.62,0:05:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Come over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.82,0:05:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you to take a look at Welsh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.90,0:05:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.94,0:05:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The Black Dragon,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.50,0:05:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Azalar, did this to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.46,0:05:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What is she doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.54,0:05:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave it to her, Bechamel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.54,0:05:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,If anyone can save Welsh,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.10,0:05:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,it's this girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.62,0:05:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, as long as Welsh is saved it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.99,0:05:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Little friend, who is this girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.99,0:05:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no dream, Khan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.99,0:06:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Welsh, just like his father Canel, \Nis being visited by a Bellaphone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.11,0:06:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,A Bellaphone?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.55,0:06:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.91,0:06:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The White Dragon,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.75,0:06:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Dardondakal, must have sent her to save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.09,0:06:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Poison!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.22,0:06:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that...\Nan ancient fragment of the Ivory Dofus?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.56,0:06:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't this girl a bit off?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.52,0:06:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Tess, that's rude!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.65,0:06:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.36,0:07:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,How can spitting something like that into \Nsomeone's mouth cure an illness?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.00,0:07:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Welsh!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.69,0:07:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Welsh!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.33,0:07:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Welsh!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.17,0:07:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Becha! Master Joris!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.21,0:07:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Can anyone hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.89,0:07:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.99,0:07:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no use...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.23,0:08:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to die like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.47,0:08:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Welsh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.90,0:08:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Whose voice is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.66,0:08:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,"Whose voice," you ask? Haha!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.54,0:08:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, who could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.39,0:08:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I like to laugh,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.63,0:08:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I like readers,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.71,0:08:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I am delicate,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.95,0:08:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,and sometimes I make humans uncomfortable!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.04,0:08:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Who am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.68,0:08:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess who! \NThe correct answer is...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.40,0:08:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Me! Dardondakal!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.91,0:08:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Save your strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.95,0:08:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,In that state, you can't go anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.63,0:08:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.35,0:08:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.39,0:08:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Quite the opposite!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.59,0:08:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I came to save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.20,0:08:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Lenka, whom I sent, gave you medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.50,0:08:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,a fragment of my Dofus.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.78,0:08:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Lenka... that girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.58,0:09:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Why her and not yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.70,0:09:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I am still inside the Dofus, Welsh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.50,0:09:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Summoning you here is one of the few ways, \NI can speak to you and Shedar.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.78,0:09:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.90,0:09:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.58,0:09:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Shedar?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.25,0:09:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The guy who tried to kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.73,0:09:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,If he really intended to kill you,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.77,0:09:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,you'd already be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.50,0:09:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince, they used a potion.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.00,0:09:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We have no idea where they are now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.65,0:09:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We must find them at all costs, Shifo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.03,0:09:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Shifo...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.35,0:09:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Shedar!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.95,0:09:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.63,0:09:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Prince Shedar.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.35,0:09:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That voice... Dardondakal!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.10,0:09:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.54,0:09:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,plotting a rebellion against my mother?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.63,0:10:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to hear that from a murderer like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.62,0:10:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.10,0:10:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it, kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.10,0:10:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.07,0:10:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You have no idea how happy I am
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.23,0:10:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,to see you two together.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.44,0:10:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I loved your families.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.67,0:10:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,They were perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.07,0:10:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,For the sake of the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.31,0:10:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,you must carry on their legacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.67,0:10:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,For that,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.03,0:10:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,you shall become my Guardians!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.83,0:10:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Guardians?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.11,0:10:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Dardondakal,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.55,0:10:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just a cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.63,0:10:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Swords aren't for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.67,0:10:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.27,0:10:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Almost getting eaten,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.75,0:10:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,getting scratched,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.07,0:10:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,getting dropped into valleys...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.24,0:10:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What I really want is to be in the kitchen with my mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.88,0:10:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I just want to go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.80,0:10:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Go home, you say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.24,0:10:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,To think this pathetic cook wants \Nto usurp my mother's throne...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.16,0:11:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And that I should betray my mother \Nto join a reckless rebellion?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.82,0:11:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You really are a strange dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.18,0:11:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother, you say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.14,0:11:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You selfish brats!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.10,0:11:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You know nothing of what's happening in this world!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.94,0:11:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine then!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.94,0:11:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I will show you right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.49,0:11:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.01,0:11:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Amakna.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.45,0:11:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the doing of Zabel, and my brother, Azalar.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.55,0:11:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Those children... they're starving!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.83,0:11:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That's impossible, you imposter!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.15,0:11:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't Amakna!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.15,0:11:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.27,0:12:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,On what grounds do you say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.84,0:12:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Amakna is the land where my mother grew up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.37,0:12:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,She would never allow such devastation!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.01,0:12:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.41,0:12:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Zabel holds all the responsibility!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.05,0:12:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.97,0:12:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The one you call "mother",
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.97,0:12:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,is nothing more than a vampire \Nwho preys on people's life force!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.17,0:12:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a lie!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.04,0:12:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Shedar.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.88,0:12:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You will eventually realize the truth too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.56,0:12:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only a matter of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.88,0:12:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, we have no time left.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.56,0:12:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Welsh,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.33,0:12:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,you must understand that this is a battle for all living beings.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.93,0:12:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,A battle between good and evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.69,0:12:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Carry on the path of your father, Canel!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.57,0:12:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,But... I have no power at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.21,0:12:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Your heart is overflowing with love.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.69,0:12:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,That is the greatest power of all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.41,0:12:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And together with Shedar-
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.20,0:12:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Dakaru...Dardondakal!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.93,0:12:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Not again...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.29,0:12:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave me alone for once!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.79,0:12:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Children!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.03,0:12:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,To defeat Zabel,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.51,0:13:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,you must locate my Dofus!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.63,0:13:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Only the Ivory Dofus can counter the Ebony Dofus!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.35,0:13:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell Joris...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.95,0:13:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,North of the Cania Plains,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.79,0:13:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,above a large lake protected by mountains,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.67,0:13:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakara is keeping me imprisoned!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.98,0:13:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Dakaru!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.02,0:13:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you scheming?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.42,0:13:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are these kids?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.58,0:13:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything depends on you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.02,0:13:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Shedar!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.98,0:13:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't mistake who your real enemy is!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.80,0:13:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Welsh!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.28,0:14:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.92,0:14:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.04,0:14:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm really hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.37,0:14:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,So that means you're cured, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.06,0:14:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Becha!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.29,0:14:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.17,0:14:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for saving me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.16,0:14:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.76,0:14:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,At my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.04,0:14:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Welsh,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.04,0:14:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,this is my wife, Lilotte.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.36,0:14:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.44,0:14:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,welcome to our humble home.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.81,0:14:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Over there is Luis.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.33,0:14:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the evil spirit haunting our house.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.89,0:14:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,He complains a lot,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.37,0:14:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,but once you get along, he's a great friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.37,0:14:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you, Luis.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.89,0:14:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.81,0:14:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Joris,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.73,0:14:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Khan...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.92,0:14:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for everything until now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.96,0:14:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally realized that I have a duty to fulfill.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.12,0:14:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Welsh,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.32,0:14:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.92,0:14:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I met the White Dragon,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.20,0:14:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Dardondakal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.48,0:15:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He showed me Queen Zabel's true form,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.72,0:15:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,and I saw what happened to Amakna because of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.40,0:15:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Dardondakal wants us to find his Dofus.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.08,0:15:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you everything I heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.56,0:15:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And I promise to do everything I can to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.92,0:15:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,But, Master Joris...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.92,0:15:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.16,0:15:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Does this house have a kitchen?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.64,0:15:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Shifo...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.12,0:15:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Shedar...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.40,0:15:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.56,0:15:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you had died.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.60,0:15:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Do dragons cry, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.44,0:15:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though we just met...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.52,0:15:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That's because
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.48,0:15:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I am not a real dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.53,0:15:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Real dragons
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.45,0:15:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,bring nothing but lies and misfortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.81,0:15:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Shifo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.49,0:15:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I know where Joris and his group are.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.17,0:16:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,There, how is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.01,0:16:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Ms. Lilotte, this is wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.06,0:16:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's less of a kitchen and more like a treasure room!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.68,0:16:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get started right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.30,0:16:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What dish should we make?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.14,0:16:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,How about a Bonta specialty, Beef Carbonnade?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.86,0:16:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a great idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.62,0:16:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Lean beef,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.66,0:16:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,bacon, onions,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.26,0:16:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,amber ale, brown sugar,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.82,0:16:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,pain d'épices...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.47,0:16:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Cooking the meat takes 3 to 4 hours,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.27,0:16:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,so you might have to wait a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.87,0:16:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,With Luis around, we can do it much faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.00,0:16:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,If Mom could have a kitchen like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.23,0:16:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,she'd pay any amount of money!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.05,0:16:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, Ms. Lilotte...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.61,0:16:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,When this adventure is over, \Ncould I live here with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.84,0:17:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Welsh said north of the Cania Plains, \Na lake protected by mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.32,0:17:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Deep in the mountain range...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.36,0:17:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Khan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.96,0:17:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not on the map, but it must be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.80,0:17:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd bet on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.16,0:17:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the only place with mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.44,0:17:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hard to find, hard to reach...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.88,0:17:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,An ideal location.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.27,0:17:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're a Bellaphone, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.15,0:17:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Bellaphone!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.35,0:17:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And the White Dragon sent you \Nto help save Welsh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.99,0:17:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Save Welsh!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.59,0:17:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.11,0:17:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Come here, it's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.43,0:17:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all the ingredients ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.99,0:17:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, the butter...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.11,0:18:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.95,0:18:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,sauté the onions in butter until translucent,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.48,0:18:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,then add the bacon
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.04,0:18:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,and turn up the heat a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.68,0:18:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Luis!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.56,0:18:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,OK!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.71,0:18:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.07,0:18:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave the pan juices behind
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.03,0:18:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,and scoop out the contents.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.99,0:18:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Add the cubed beef to the pot,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.63,0:18:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,and crank up the heat a little more!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.47,0:18:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Aye aye, Chef!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.32,0:18:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,The meat is getting a nice sear!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.20,0:18:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Luis!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.64,0:18:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,All those delicious juices coming out!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.10,0:18:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Add brown sugar to the remaining juices.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.46,0:18:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn to high heat
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.46,0:18:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,and reduce it by half.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.82,0:18:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Luis,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.78,0:18:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,do you understand how happy working in a kitchen makes me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.43,0:19:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,And besides... this kitchen is the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.07,0:19:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm happy too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.55,0:19:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Working with a pro is fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.11,0:19:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.87,0:19:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,a delicious syrup is ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.03,0:19:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Put the onions and bacon back in
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.35,0:19:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,and stir.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.89,0:19:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Add the cooked meat and stir once more.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.66,0:19:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,A bouquet garni too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.82,0:19:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Then pour in beer
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.56,0:19:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,until everything is submerged.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.58,0:19:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Next up, pain d'épices!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.87,0:19:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Spread mustard on the pain d'épices,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.43,0:19:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,arrange them neatly over the ingredients,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.43,0:19:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,cover with a lid, and let it simmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.07,0:19:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,While it simmers,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.96,0:19:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll fry up some potatoes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.09,0:20:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Ms. Lilotte,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.17,0:20:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,thank you for welcoming me so warmly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.05,0:20:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Drop the "Ms."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.73,0:20:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Just call me Lilotte.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.96,0:20:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Lilotte,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.16,0:20:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,you are like a mother to my daughters.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.92,0:21:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I think having you by their side is \Nthe best thing for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.56,0:21:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If I don't return...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.91,0:21:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave those girls to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.79,0:21:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.71,0:21:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Joris,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.91,0:21:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,please come back soon, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.95,0:21:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.91,0:21:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise, Lilotte.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.94,0:21:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.18,0:21:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you might try that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.50,0:21:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.14,0:21:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you really think you could leave us behind?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.54,0:21:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,We can read your mind like a book!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.10,0:21:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Luis!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.25,0:21:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Luis!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.97,0:21:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Open up!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.10,0:21:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You traitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.65,0:21:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad, this isn't funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.33,0:21:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Girls!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.58,0:21:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to see your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.53,0:22:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You know I had to go sooner or later.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.65,0:22:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,This is your father's final match.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.88,0:22:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.92,0:22:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can't we come with you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.08,0:22:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,If it's your final match, \Nwe should be there too!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.64,0:22:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You might be mad at me for the rest of your lives for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.00,0:22:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Even so, I cannot take you with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.99,0:22:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Blitz,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.07,0:22:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Tess,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.87,0:22:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Kara...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.80,0:22:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,The three of you will be fine no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.23,0:22:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to become legendary Gobbowl players.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.00,0:22:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You three are your father's champions.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.36,0:22:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing was ever more wonderful than \Nthe days I spent with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.76,0:22:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.70,0:22:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.32,0:22:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.13,0:23:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It feels like I'm abandoning them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.61,0:23:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.81,0:23:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.73,0:23:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,let's go before I change my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.42,0:23:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,DAD!
